# merge()
# Pushes the tracked pose (and Rotation, if set) onto the armor stand.
# One command per call - the animation loops rely on this costing a
# tick, same as the original library. The spaces around the template
# keep the SNBT braces from being read as part of the {{ }} marker.
@using entity_ai

@bypass /data merge entity {{this.entity.getUniqueId()}} { {{this.string()}} }
